{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Trader AI Dashboard v1\n",
    "\n",
    "这是第一版个人交易市场仪表盘：下载跨资产日线数据、计算基础指标、判断市场状态、绘制走势并生成中文解读。\n",
    "\n",
    "**使用方式：** 在 Colab 中先将整个项目克隆或上传到 `/content`，让运行环境中能够找到 `src/` 文件夹，然后从上到下运行本 Notebook。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Colab 首次运行时安装所需包；本地环境已安装后可跳过本单元格。\n",
    "%pip -q install yfinance pandas numpy matplotlib"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "# Notebook 可能从项目根目录、notebooks/ 文件夹，或 Colab 的临时目录启动。\n",
    "candidates = [Path.cwd(), Path.cwd().parent, Path('/content/trader-ai-dashboard')]\n",
    "PROJECT_ROOT = next((path for path in candidates if (path / 'src').exists()), None)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 从 GitHub 直接在 Colab 打开 Notebook 时，Colab 不会自动下载 src/ 文件夹。\n",
    "# 因此在未找到项目代码时，自动克隆公开仓库以补齐运行所需模块。\n",
    "if PROJECT_ROOT is None and Path('/content').exists():\n",
    "    clone_target = Path('/content/trader-ai-dashboard')\n",
    "    if not clone_target.exists():\n",
    "        print('未检测到完整项目，正在从 GitHub 下载源码...')\n",
    "        subprocess.run(\n",
    "            ['git', 'clone', 'https://github.com/cottonlyz-coder/trader-ai-dashboard.git', str(clone_target)],\n",
    "            check=True,\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    PROJECT_ROOT = clone_target if (clone_target / 'src').exists() else None\n",
    "\n",
    "if PROJECT_ROOT is None:\n",
    "    raise FileNotFoundError('未找到 src/ 文件夹。请将完整项目放在当前环境后重新运行。')\n",
    "\n",
    "if str(PROJECT_ROOT) not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.insert(0, str(PROJECT_ROOT))\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from IPython.display import Markdown, display\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.data_loader import load_market_data\n",
    "from src.indicators import calculate_market_metrics, normalized_prices\n",
    "from src.regime import classify_market_regime\n",
    "from src.report import generate_trader_commentary\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Project root: {PROJECT_ROOT}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 下载市场数据\n",
    "\n",
    "每个市场会先尝试优先 ticker；如果没有数据且存在 fallback，则自动尝试替代 ticker。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "prices, symbol_info, messages = load_market_data(period='6mo')\n",
    "\n",
    "display(Markdown('### 实际使用的数据序列'))\n",
    "display(symbol_info)\n",
    "\n",
    "if messages:\n",
    "    display(Markdown('### 数据提示'))\n",
    "    for message in messages:\n",
    "        print('-', message)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'\\nDownloaded {len(prices)} trading-day rows through {prices.index.max().date()}.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 关键市场指标\n",
    "\n",
    "20 日波动率按日收益率标准差计算，并使用 252 个交易日进行年化。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "metrics = calculate_market_metrics(prices)\n",
    "display(\n",
    "    metrics.style.format({\n",
    "        'Latest Price': '{:,.2f}',\n",
    "        '1D Change (%)': '{:+.2f}%',\n",
    "        '5D Change (%)': '{:+.2f}%',\n",
    "        '20D Change (%)': '{:+.2f}%',\n",
    "        '20D Volatility (%)': '{:.2f}%',\n",
    "    })\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 市场状态"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "regime = classify_market_regime(metrics)\n",
    "display(Markdown(f'## Market Regime: **{regime.label}**  (score: {regime.score:+d})'))\n",
    "for reason in regime.reasons:\n",
    "    print('-', reason)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 归一化走势图\n",
    "\n",
    "不同资产的起始点统一设为 100，方便观察相对变化趋势，而不是比较绝对价格。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "rebased = normalized_prices(prices)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(14, 7))\n",
    "for asset in rebased.columns:\n",
    "    plt.plot(rebased.index, rebased[asset], label=asset, linewidth=1.8)\n",
    "plt.axhline(100, color='grey', linewidth=1, linestyle='--')\n",
    "plt.title('Normalized Market Performance (Start = 100)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Normalized Price')\n",
    "plt.grid(alpha=0.25)\n",
    "plt.legend(loc='best')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 交易员视角市场解读\n",
    "\n",
    "v1 的文字由可审核规则生成；后续阶段可以在保留原始指标的前提下接入 OpenAI API 生成更丰富的日报。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "commentary = generate_trader_commentary(metrics, regime)\n",
    "display(Markdown(commentary.replace('\\n\\n', '\\n\\n')))"
   ]
  }
 ],
